              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RebeckaK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have never had butter beer. In fact, I have never read the books that inspired it. However, I can say with assurance, that this drink is worth making.\n\nI am giving it 5 stars, but that is based o me using this recipe as a base. I added cinnamon and baking spices. Next time I make it I will cut the sugar (may leave it out) and use vanilla beans in place of the extract.\nThis drink is incredibly warming and would be perfect for a snowy day."
          },
