            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ariella"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Ohhh boy, this is delicious! Even though I cut the amount of the sweetened condensed milk by nearly 3/4, I still have to give the combo of ingredients 5 stars. Something magical happens when you add that butter. We made it for Thanksgiving and was loved by all, even more loved with a shot of rum in the mug. My 7 year old said \"no wonder Harry, Ron and Hermione like this so much.\" This recipe is the easiest one out there with the title of \"Butterbeer\" so give it a try. I would recommend starting out with a small amount of the sweetened condensed milk and add to taste.",
